<title>USA: Bet holdings to discontinue YSB Magazine.</title>
<headline>Bet holdings to discontinue YSB Magazine.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>BET Holdings Inc said Monday it will discontinue publication of YSB Magazine, which targetted young, African-American adults.</p>
<p>BET said the magazine lost $1.9 million for the fiscal year ending July 31, 1996.</p>
